# Applies when building with BuildKit and `-f docker/idp/Dockerfile`.
# Anything that reaches the build context can end up in an image layer, even
# if a later RUN deletes it - so runtime state and every key stay out entirely.
**/.venv
**/.venv-win
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
# Runtime state: the database and ALL key material, including the project CA
# (certs/ca/) and the mTLS certificates (certs/pki/).
**/data/
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/certs/
.git
.claude
.env
docs
